                <pb facs="0419" n="413" xml:id="pg413"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Mr. Snowden</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-01-02"><hi rendition="#italic">January 2,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>On receipt instruction 53, Mora urge minister of state to empower Dupuy Lôme by
                    cable, if possible, to arrange full claims convention. Congress adjourns in
                    sixty days.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Foster.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
